</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Spread into my heart, O Lord Jesus,</l><l>Spread into my heart, I pray;</l><l>Spread into my heart from my spirit,</l><l>Spread into my heart today.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Make home in my heart, O Lord Jesus,</l><l>Make home in my heart, I pray;</l><l>That we may be filled with Your fullness,</l><l>Make home in my heart today.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To Him who is able to do it</l><l>Above all we think or say,</l><l>We open our hearts wide and welcome</l><l>Him into our heart today.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
